<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/DA(0 g /Helv 7.6 Tf)/F 4/FT/Tx/MK<<>>/P 1 0 R/Rect[71.5635 297.42 549.708 319.42]/T(Text17)/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/Ff 4096/V(Requested as soon as possible \(Fall 2026\). No AI features \(it blocks AI\). Security answers, VPAT 2.5 and HECVAT 4 attached; no SOC 2 yet \(hosted on Cloudflare, which holds SOC 2 Type II\).)/AP<</N 257 0 R>>>>
