4 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/DA(0 g /Helv 7.6 Tf)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4098/MK<<>>/P 1 0 R/Rect[71.1271 491.164 549.272 513.164]/T(Text14)/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/V(Instructors need open-note quizzes without AI. The deployed Respondus LockDown Browser blocks all other apps, files and websites, so it cannot run open-note; no deployed LTI blocks only AI.)/AP<</N 254 0 R>>>>
endobj

