<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/DA(0 g /Helv 10 Tf)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4098/MK<<>>/P 1 0 R/Rect[71.1271 534.801 550.581 606.982]/T(Text13)/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/V(LTI 1.3 Advantage: \(1\) LTI launch, so an instructor opens the LOCKqz dashboard from Brightspace with single sign-on; \(2\) Names and Roles Provisioning Service, so an instructor sees which of their enrolled students have installed LOCKqz; \(3\) optional Valence API access scoped to quizzing, to set a quiz's access password automatically. No grade passback. No access to quiz content, answers or grades.)/AP<</N 253 0 R>>>>
