11 0 obj
<</Type/Annot/Subtype/Widget/DA(0 g /Helv 10 Tf)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4098/MK<<>>/P 1 0 R/Rect[70.2544 628.618 549.708 699.927]/T(Text12)/BS<</S/S/W 1>>/V(LOCKqz blocks AI tools \(ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Copilot, Perplexity and similar\) on a student's own Mac or Windows computer only while a designated Brightspace quiz is open, then restores them when the quiz is submitted. Notes, files and the rest of the web stay available, so open-note quizzes stay open-note but AI-free. It is not a proctoring tool: no camera, microphone, screen capture or keystroke logging.)/AP<</N 252 0 R>>>>
endobj

